      "content": "Quadra design system and brand library. Foundations: the design tokens (color, typography, shape, spacing, elevation). Components: buttons, chips, segment, tool toggle, form controls (slider, number input, select, checkbox), sidebar panel parts, header, canvas overlays (handles, crop rect, loupe). App icon: the brand mark. Area files import this library; edit components here."
